{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_1BDCEAAD","title":"Back in Business","entry":"Dlg_1BDCEAAD::entry","exit":"Dlg_1BDCEAAD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2B23766D","articyId":"72057778721530620","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"That was quick! Parts are actually stacking up here. Didn't think I'd see it happen.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That was quick! Parts are actually stacking up here. Didn't think I'd see it happen.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17903","byteOffset":14661464,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_D3B1AF07","articyId":"72057778721530648","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"All the kinds. Everything I need to keep this grimy metal raft floating, even though it would be better at the bottom of the sea.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All the kinds. Everything I need to keep this grimy metal raft floating, even though it would be better at the bottom of the sea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31020","byteOffset":19617576,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_259D3358","articyId":"72057778721530669","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Ha! Depends what that cluster klutz has gotten his hands on.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha! Depends what that cluster klutz has gotten his hands on.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47302","byteOffset":32231432,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_55D1BCDA","articyId":"72057778721530676","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Ehhhh, just some of the stuff they're talking about out here has gotten kinda mad.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ehhhh, just some of the stuff they're talking about out here has gotten kinda mad.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34354","byteOffset":20879656,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_2778D371","articyId":"72057778721530699","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Right on, champ. Thanks for your help. Hey, you ever need something fixed up come and see me. I got you.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right on, champ. Thanks for your help. Hey, you ever need something fixed up come and see me. I got you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29803","byteOffset":19156000,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_A04C6439","articyId":"72057778721530714","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Yeah, you ain't kiddin'. But look, you ever need something fixed you come and see me. I'll put yah on the top of the list.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, you ain't kiddin'. But look, you ever need something fixed you come and see me. I'll put yah on the top of the list.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2574.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36244","byteOffset":28058528,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_5E732330","articyId":"72057778721530735","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Ha. Payment woulda have to have been negotiated beforehand. Maybe you should go back and pick up some tips from the shit head shippers.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha. Payment woulda have to have been negotiated beforehand. Maybe you should go back and pick up some tips from the shit head shippers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35408","byteOffset":25755448,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_71B202B8","articyId":"72057778721530742","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Yeah, yeah, take this alright? Thanks for your help. You need anything taken care of in the future come see me. I'll fix it right up.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, yeah, take this alright? Thanks for your help. You need anything taken care of in the future come see me. I'll fix it right up.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48443","byteOffset":32662000,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_E2DB6D52","articyId":"72057778721530770","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Heard that before. Look, I gotta keep unpacking this stuff but you ever need something fixed you come see me. I got you covered.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Heard that before. Look, I gotta keep unpacking this stuff but you ever need something fixed you come see me. I got you covered.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30595","byteOffset":19454952,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_3E91226F","articyId":"72057821671306165","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Like dropping vacuum tubes into the ocean floor to try and filter new dirt. Like what the Neon Gods is new dirt? Dirt's just dirt.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Like dropping vacuum tubes into the ocean floor to try and filter new dirt. Like what the Neon Gods is new dirt? Dirt's just dirt.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27231","byteOffset":18181664,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_8C872AEC","articyId":"72057821671306180","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Botan Noss","text":"Anything that kid touches either cracks, dents, or catches on fire. If I didn't have to fix all of it I'd think it were a gift.","speakerId":"Ntt_54000CAA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Anything that kid touches either cracks, dents, or catches on fire. If I didn't have to fix all of it I'd think it were a gift.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18963","byteOffset":15060848,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_2E9CAD6F","articyId":"72057778721530625","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Happy to help.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText